# The dissertation itself is kept off the public repository.
# The repository URL is cited in the dissertation's Appendix A, so anything committed
# here is published. Publishing the report before it is marked risks a similarity
# check matching the student's own public copy, and the folder also held the module
# handbook (the university's copyrighted document) and private assessment feedback.
# The whole folder is therefore local-only; it was removed from the history, not just
# from the current commit.
report/

